The relational operations provided at Pig Latin operate on data. They transform 
data using sorting, grouping,joining, projecting and filtering. Followings are the 
basic relational operators: 

Foreach FOREACH gives a simple way to apply transformations based on 
columns. It is Pig's projection operator. Table 4.17 gives examples using 
FOREACH. 

